#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707924 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1bf9b6bb-4e83-5c74-baf3-ff4e5472d036" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} = 14\\\\&y \\neq 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707896} {:answer/id #uuid "1e2e14d6-a8fc-56ab-95dc-df647512c2c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\mathbb R^2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707897} {:answer/id #uuid "3587d7c6-607e-5f34-812a-1ab56d75bd4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\\\&y < 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707900} {:answer/id #uuid "3c649e3a-9404-5727-899d-680e4da9ad6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\\\&y \\neq 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707903} {:answer/id #uuid "a9f794c4-251f-5607-b8e7-eb815be41237" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\\\&y = 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707921}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3c649e3a-9404-5727-899d-680e4da9ad6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\\\&y \\neq 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707903} :answer-field/id #uuid "fa328055-ba38-5dd0-b756-252e20bddecf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707927}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "c49f4e67-4940-5fdd-8cfe-7e2f06fc791b" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2} - 14} \\right)}\\,i+\\left(\\frac{\\left(-1\\right) x y}{y}\\right)\\,j.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{2} + y^{2} - 14} \\right)}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\frac{\\left(-1\\right) x y}{y}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $x^{2} + y^{2} - 14 \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_P=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\right\\}$.\n\nQ: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $y \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y \\neq 0\\right\\}$.\n\nThe domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,\\begin{aligned}&x^{2} + y^{2} \\neq 14\\\\&y \\neq 0\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707928 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "212f87ea-6cf1-5390-b212-21f958465eb6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} - y - 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707898} {:answer/id #uuid "251cd63a-3c6c-5ea9-a69f-c5831aa48e86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 \\leq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707899} {:answer/id #uuid "50bb48af-fcf4-574d-b8dd-393a3efab4bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- x - 6 y^{2} - 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707906} {:answer/id #uuid "83dbd2d0-5b01-5973-b479-c92425f707b8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 = 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707914} {:answer/id #uuid "af9fac04-2a70-5db7-9e30-259316ffc791" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707922}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "af9fac04-2a70-5db7-9e30-259316ffc791" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707922} :answer-field/id #uuid "de5f23f3-21d4-5d46-b81b-4ec573cc9ee4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707925}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "fdeb137c-1e73-56d2-abcf-6d86424c5825" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=\\ln{\\left(- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 \\right)}\\,i+\\left(\\left(x^{2} + y^{2}\\right) e^{\\frac{1}{y}}\\right)\\,j.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=\\ln{\\left(- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 \\right)}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\left(x^{2} + y^{2}\\right) e^{\\frac{1}{y}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: The logarithm argument must be strictly positive.\n\nThe required conditions are $- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 > 0$.\n\nThus $D_P=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 > 0\\right\\}$.\n\nQ: Every denominator must be nonzero, including a square root in a denominator.\n\nThe required conditions are $y \\neq 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y \\neq 0\\right\\}$.\n\nThe logarithm's strict inequality already excludes the zero denominator in the exponential. The domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,- 6 x^{2} + y - 3 > 0\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707950 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0cd7e94c-5caa-5899-8aa7-99019e28fe30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 < 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707949} {:answer/id #uuid "2cb5690c-5cda-544b-aadf-bf38cc714e23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707954} {:answer/id #uuid "9408fbe1-83d6-57f7-8447-94cb1c880249" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707960} {:answer/id #uuid "9f005d83-4947-5346-9066-364159d5b9b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 \\geq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707962} {:answer/id #uuid "dc42fb18-6d9a-54ab-b677-34b2c816923c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 = 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707972}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2cb5690c-5cda-544b-aadf-bf38cc714e23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707954} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e097b48-b831-5f3d-9541-24a12b87046b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707957}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "15c45fcf-ec89-5f70-b1fb-1924d792b7ef" :question/problem "Determine the domain of the real vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=x^{2}\\,i+\\left(\\ln{\\left(y + 3 \\right)}\\right)\\,j.\n$$\n\nRemember: both component functions must be defined." :question/worked-solution "Write $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(x,y)&=x^{2}\\\\Q(x,y)&=\\ln{\\left(y + 3 \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nP: This polynomial is defined everywhere in the real plane.\n\nThus $D_P=\\mathbb R^2$.\n\nQ: The logarithm argument must be strictly positive.\n\nThe required conditions are $y + 3 > 0$.\n\nThus $D_Q=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 > 0\\right\\}$.\n\nThe domain is the intersection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D&=D_P\\cap D_Q\\\\&=\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,y + 3 > 0\\right\\}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186707955 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "986974e8-fa02-5e0a-8d47-c7ef11110439" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 1 = 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707961} {:answer/id #uuid "ae157bf7-b326-5a9f-ab85-170b331dfc67" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 1 > 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707967} {:answer/id #uuid "b998c61d-6a11-5c05-971e-25260eb68e06" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 1 < 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707968} {:answer/id #uuid "e73f243a-2a32-5e4c-a8ec-5444d4ddbc99" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left\\{(x,y)\\in\\mathbb R^2\\,|\\,x + 1 \\leq 0\\right\\}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186707974} {:answer/id #uuid "f47dcf9b-37d5-55b2-8fe2-17154dfc078b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answ